  "cues": [
   [
    0.117,
    "These two belong to a larger team."
   ],
   [
    2.331,
    "The endomembrane system has six components."
   ],
   [
    5.391,
    "The nuclear envelope, the ER, the Golgi apparatus, lysosomes, vacuoles, and the plasma membrane."
   ],
   [
    12.682,
    "They are either continuous with each other, or linked when vesicles carry material between them."
   ],
   [
    18.411,
    "Lysosomes and vacuoles wait for the next lesson."
   ],
   [
    21.81,
    "The ER is the biggest of them."
   ],
   [
    23.698,
    "In most eukaryotic cells, it makes up more than half of all the membrane."
   ],
   [
    28.359,
    "And it is continuous with the nuclear envelope, so the space inside the ER opens straight onto the nucleus."
   ]
  ]
